    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Oct 2023 05:47:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>肖邦《雨滴前奏曲》</span><br><span>Prelude of Raindrops</span></strong><br><span></span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>当淅淅沥沥的雨滴敲打在屋顶的时候</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我想，你应该是温暖又自在的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>随着曲风一转的曲调急剧向下</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>些许焦急的等待映入眼帘</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>然后又缓缓地回归最初的单调</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这种感觉犹如早秋</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>哪怕一年中的大多数时光已经凋零</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>但希望还在生长呀</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这就是我想告诉你的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>雨滴前奏曲的故事</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划出品|TheeMedia</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案编辑|Rita&amp;Cynthia</span></p><span></span><p><span>采编播|颜颜公主</span></p>]]></description>
