  <item>
    <title>007.无词歌猎歌船歌.古典音乐汪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6511158f96875579712cf080</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6511158f96875579712cf080</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Sep 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>门德尔松《无词歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mendelssohn: Songs Without Words</span></p><span></span><p><span>无词歌，顾名思义，就是在伴奏声部的衬托下，</span></p><span></span><p><span>旋律的进行仿若唱歌的钢琴独奏曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>浪漫主义的钢琴音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>从舞曲、组曲、夜曲、即兴曲、变奏曲等等</span></p><span></span><p><span>转向了随意、无拘无束的独立曲式</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些非传统奏鸣曲的分水岭</span></p><span></span><p><span>最初呈现在门德尔松的键盘上</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了让听众更好地理解，有人给无词歌加上了标题</span></p><span></span><p><span>如“猎歌”、“春风”、“纺车”……</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天就从春之歌的A大调旋律听起</span></p><span></span><p><span>再倾听《升F小调“威尼斯船歌”》</span></p><span></span><p><span>及《A大调猎歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个歌曲就像一个故事，每次听都有不一样的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>无词，胜有词。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv8mzz7t8cdcugIhvHzUZvR_B_58.m4a" length="20640903" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVXuVapxDnaxhnydCG1aY2T9dC1.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>7</itunes:episode>
